                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='27000' id='6' type-v2='text' w='60200' x='28200' y='55875'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>...This project is the answer, built and tested end to end: forensic cleaning, six behavioral fields, a working Tableau dashboard, and 31 rotatable 3D exhibits — proving the method on a well-known, thoroughly-picked-over dataset on purpose, so nothing about the result could be credited to novel data.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5875' id='7' type-v2='text' w='51100' x='46900' y='87250'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>It&apos;s built to reward scrutiny, not skimming. →</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{2060E49D-459C-4120-B75A-CE3335738EF5}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 02 - One Dataset Three Functions'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9375' id='3' type-v2='text' w='86300' x='5500' y='2375'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='24'>One dataset. Three business functions.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>────────────</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>───────</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='36000' id='4' type-v2='text' w='86900' x='5100' y='6500'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>The 3D drill-down was proven first — on the thing this project was actually built to test. Everything after that was supposed to be the demonstration, not a second discovery.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>It didn&apos;t stay that way. I hadn&apos;t planned to look for it in advance, but once I was in — cleaned once, at forensic-grade discipline — I realized what was actually available to pull out and look at. The same table held value in three places:</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='41250' id='5' type-v2='text' w='27600' x='2300' y='37750'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>┌─────────────────┐ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14' underline='true'>Marketing &amp; Retention</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Customer-level RFM, in 3D. </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Who&apos;s about to lapse, who already has, </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>and the one outlier</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> that breaks the pattern everyone else follows.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>└─────────────────┘</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='42875' id='6' type-v2='text' w='27600' x='34900' y='36250'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>┌──────────────────┐ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14' underline='true'>Warehousing &amp; Purchasing</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>The same discipline, </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>pointed at SKUs instead of customers. </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>What&apos;s overdue for restock, </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>what&apos;s actually dead stock, </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>and what only </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14' italic='true'>looks</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> dead</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> because nobody checked the season.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>└──────────────────┘</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='42875' id='7' type-v2='text' w='30400' x='65900' y='36125'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>┌───────────────────┐ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14' underline='true'>Operations &amp; Data Collection</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Not a finding </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14' italic='true'>from</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> the data, but a finding </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14' italic='true'>about</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> how the data gets collected. What changes upstream would save the next analyst the hours this project spent cleaning it.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>└───────────────────┘</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12000' id='8' type-v2='text' w='85500' x='6300' y='82250'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Three stakeholders. Three different questions.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>One dataset, one method, one cleaning pass — never touched twice.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
