    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 03 - Why UK Retail'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='4875' id='3' type-v2='text' w='24100' x='36500' y='9375'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='24' underline='true'>Why UK Retail?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11000' id='4' type-v2='text' w='79200' x='9400' y='18500'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>This dataset has been picked over hundreds of times. That&apos;s not a weakness in the choice — it&apos;s the reason for it.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='33000' id='5' type-v2='text' w='88300' x='5400' y='31375'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>A novel dataset would leave an open question hanging over every finding in this project: is the result real, or is it just because nobody&apos;s looked this closely before? UK Online Retail II closes that door before it opens. Anything found here has to hold up against a dataset where the obvious insights were already found years ago, by other analysts, using other methods.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='27000' id='6' type-v2='text' w='89300' x='5300' y='62375'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>That&apos;s the actual test. Not &quot;what&apos;s hiding in this data&quot; — the well-known findings are already known. The test was always &quot;does 3D drill-down get an analyst somewhere a flat chart and a familiar dataset couldn&apos;t.&quot; If it works here, on data this thoroughly worked over already, it isn&apos;t the dataset doing the work.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='28' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
